  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. • Cut pumpkin into thin wedges. • In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. • Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with Asian BBQ seasoning and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat. • Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06d835963fcd98f3ba0a/step-49a26600.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, trim and roughly chop pea pods. • Thinly slice red radish and long chilli (if using). • Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06d835963fcd98f3ba0a/step-80b15810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Just before serving, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. • Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate.</p> <p>• In a large bowl, combine deluxe salad mix, mixed salad leaves, pea pods, red radish, garlic aioli and Japanese style dressing. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06d835963fcd98f3ba0a/step-f116b820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide slaw between bowls. • Top with Asian BBQ roast pumpkin and haloumi, crunchy fried noodles and chilli to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06d835963fcd98f3ba0a/step-e4bb7530.jpg"
    }
  ]
